      "title": "固态电池概念盘中持续走高，多股收获涨停，力王股份30cm涨停",
      "author": null,
      "content": "<p>10月8日，<a data-code=\"886032\" data-position=\"stock.4\" data-marketid=\"48\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:886032:sc*#\">固态电池</a>概念盘中持续走高，力王股份(920627.BJ)30cm涨停，此前<a data-code=\"300619\" data-position=\"stock.12\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:300619:sc*#\">金银河</a>(<a data-code=\"300619\" data-position=\"stock.11\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:300619:sc*#\">300619</a>.SZ)、<a data-code=\"002058\" data-position=\"stock.2\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:002058:sc*#\">紫竹高科</a>(<a data-code=\"002058\" data-position=\"stock.1\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:002058:sc*#\">002058</a>.SZ)、<a data-code=\"002805\" data-position=\"stock.6\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:002805:sc*#\">丰元股份</a>(<a data-code=\"002805\" data-position=\"stock.5\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:002805:sc*#\">002805</a>.SZ)、<a data-code=\"002733\" data-position=\"stock.8\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:002733:sc*#\">雄韬股份</a>(<a data-code=\"002733\" data-position=\"stock.7\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:002733:sc*#\">002733</a>.SZ)、<a data-code=\"002866\" data-position=\"stock.10\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:002866:sc*#\">传艺科技</a>(<a data-code=\"002866\" data-position=\"stock.9\" data-marketid=\"33\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:002866:sc*#\">002866</a>.SZ)等多股涨停，武汉蓝电(920779.BJ)涨超20%，纳科诺尔(920522.BJ)、灵鸽科技(920284.BJ)双双涨超10%。</p><p>消息面上，工信部等七部门联合印发的《新型电池产业发展“十五五”规划》，规划提出到2030年全<a data-code=\"886032\" data-position=\"stock.4\" data-marketid=\"48\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:886032:sc*#\">固态电池</a>初步实现规模化应用、长寿命<a data-code=\"884309\" data-position=\"stock.14\" data-marketid=\"49\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:884309:sc*#\">锂电池</a>循环寿命达1.5万次等目标，并持续开展<a data-code=\"884309\" data-position=\"stock.14\" data-marketid=\"49\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:884309:sc*#\">锂电池</a>标准体系建设、推进全<a data-code=\"886032\" data-position=\"stock.4\" data-marketid=\"48\" data-type=\"stock\" href=\"#*f:886032:sc*#\">固态电池</a>与钠电池等重点领域标准研制。</p>",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.caiwennews.com/article/1639346.shtml",
